Gifted (A very wise man with several decades of experience and a master of the yoga arts, to the point of being considered one of the seven yoga masters in the world.Street Fighter V - Dhalsim's Character Story Serves as a spiritual guide and mentor to many people and is always ready to give precious advice to those who seek help, such as Ryu, Alex, the Player and all the peregrines visiting his temple. Is an expert in mysticism and philosophy, and often engages in discussions on the matter with Oro. He is also a great martial artist, having developed many abilities through meditation and self-improvement. Even when holding back, he can battle on par with the likes of Karin, Ryu, Necalli, Alex, Rufus, Rashid, Rainbow Mika |-|Unique Attacks= YogaUpper.gif|Yoga Upper Divine kick.gif|Divine Kick ThrustKick.gif|Thrust Kick YogaAnvil.gif|Yoga Anvil DrillKick.gif|Drill Kick Yoga mummy.gif|Yoga Mummy Yoga tower.gif| Yoga Tower Yoga chop.gif|Yoga Chop YogaSweep.gif|Yoga Sweep Focus dhalsim.gif|Focus Attack *Yoga Upper: Dhalsim performs a quick, open-handed, uppercut that hits almost vertically above him. *Divine Kick: Dhalsim performs a front kick with his hands put together. *Thrust Kick: Dhalsim crouches low and extends his leg out toward his opponent. *Yoga Anvil: Dhalsim extends both of his arms upward at a 45° angle. *Yoga Spear/Drill Kick: Dhalsim performs a drill-like kick downward towards his opponent. *Yoga Mummy: Dhalsim slowly twirls downward, spinning like a drill, and hitting the opponent headfirst. *Yoga Tower: Dhalsim raises his body into the air by stretching his leg, allowing most attacks to pass under him. *Yoga Chop: Dhalsim strikes his opponent with a downward, open-handed chop. *Yoga Sweep: Dhalsim stretches his leg and slides forward, hitting the opponent with the tip of his foot. *Focus
--- 2 [intelligence] ken-masters.yaml
Gifted (Ken is an extremely skilled martial artist, having trained for many years together with Ryu under Gouken. He developed his own variation of the Ansatsuken style, combining kicks, rapid movements and a particular attention and focus on the Shoryuken. Invented his Shoryureppa on the fly to defeat an opponent who could counter his Shoryuken.All About Street Fighter ZERO 2 Won many martial arts tournaments until he became the undisputed american champion, gaining worldwide fame and attention from numerous people, such as Rufus, who wants to claim the title from him, and Sean, Ken's future pupil.All About Street Fighter ZERO 3 During his career he traded fists with a pletora of professional fighters, with some notable ones being Chun-Li, Cammy, Guile, Laura, Karin, Zangief, F.A.N.G, Sakura, Luke and, most importantly, Ryu, his eternal rival. Ken also efficiently runs the Masters Foundation, one of the wealthiest companies in the world, which he inherited from his family. Despite his occasional cockyness, Ken is overall a level-headed and reasonable person, who takes in great care the safety of his beloved ones. He is also particularly skilled in cooking pasta.Street Fighter V: Champion Edition - Official Website) Note: Violent Ken is a non-canonical character featured only in Ultra Street Fighter II: The Final Challengers Notable Attacks/Techniques: Inazuma.gif|Inazuma Kick Thunderkick.gif|Thunder Kick KenFeint.gif|Thunder Kick - Feint ChinBuster.gif|Chin Buster ChinBuster2nd.gif|Chin Buster 2nd LionBreaker.gif|Lion Breaker TripleFlashKicks.gif|Triple Flash Kicks FlameStrike.gif|Flame Strike LightningCrack.gif|Lighting Crack KenStepKick.gif|Forward Step Kick Focus Ken.gif|Focus Attack *Inazuma Kick: Ken performs an overhead following-legged axe kick that hits the opponent two times via his heel. *Thunder Kick: Ken slightly rushes forward and delivers an overhead axe kick with his leading leg. Ken can also suddenly interrupt the move, performing a feint. *Chin Buster: Ken delivers a punch into the chest region. *Chin Buster 2nd: Ken delivers a punch into the chest, followed by an uppercut to the chin, launching the opponent into the air. *Lion Breaker: Ken hits his opponent with a high roundhouse kick to the head, followed by a crescent kick which will launch the opponent into the air. *Triple Flash Kicks: A sequence of three, long-reaching roundhouse kicks. *Flame Strike: Ken lunges forward with a heavy hook. *Lighting Crack: Ken blocks an incoming attack and replies with a powerful knee. *Forward Step Kick: Ken steps forward and then launches a fast kick at the opponent. *Focus
--- 3 [intelligence] m-bison.yaml
Genius M. Bison is a great strategist and leader, being the founder and commander of Shadaloo, the most powerful criminal organization on the planet, which he even recreated anew after its first downfall. M. Bison raised his organization through an unyielding pursue for power, wresting it from the hands of his rivals in an endless storm of battles against the many who desired to kill him. Eventually, he gained control over all the other organizations of the underworld.Side Readers: Toxicity (Part 1) Shadaloo and its divisions, such as S.I.N., possess advanced technology,extensive military resources,Ultra Street Fighter IV - Rolento's Prologue several bases all around the world and have their fingers in every type of activity, legal or illegal, ranging from drug trafficking, arms manifacturing and human experiments, to controlling the high ranks of the US military, which take orders directly from M. Bison.Super Street Fighter IV Original Video AnimationStreet Fighter 30th Anniversary CollectionStreet Fighter V - Nash's Character Story He could correctly predict how a number of events would unfold over the years, such as the time he manipulated Seth and S.I.N.'s actions from behind the scenes, stating that everything had gone according to his plan.Street Fighter IV: The Ties That Bind He even predicted Necalli's arrival, his defeat by the hands of Ryu and the fact that the latter would have eventually faced him; even his own defeat may have been part of his schemes. Conducted various projects for world conquest and to increase his power, representing a constant threat and often going close to achieving his goals. Has always a backup plan and a number of contingencies in case something would befall him, hence why he managed to cheat death on several occasions. M. Bison was a talented martial artist in his youth, one of the few in possession of Soul Power. Upon discovering the alluring Psycho Power, he swiftly surpassed his master and killed him. He used Psycho Power to develop his personal fighting style mold a great vaeriety of abilities and techniques. Ryu considers him one of the greatest martial artists to ever live, belittling only his evil heart and power. His skill allows him to frequently hold back and toy with expert fighters of the caliber of Chun-Li, Guile, Juri Han, Charlie Nash and F.A.N.G, even countering all of the latter's countless killing techniques. Has often traded fists with the likes of Ryu, Rose and others. Could hold his own against Power of Nothingness Ryu and even Akuma recognized him as a worthy opponent, despite the difference in strength.Street Fighter Alpha 2 - Akuma's Ending Notes: *Despite having been canonically defeated by Charlie Nash in Street Fighter Alpha 2, their fight has been subject to a retcon in Street Fighter V.Street Fighter Alpha 2 - Charlie Nash's Ending In fact, it was stated that Bison's power had already surpassed far beyond the bounds of Nash's imagination. *The Black Moons don't charge M. Bison with their energy. Instead, they are meant to cause destruction all around the world and bring out extreme negative emotions, then channel them into M. Bison, as they are what his Psycho Power feeds on. *M. Bison's profile from All About Street Fighter Zero 2 states that he can't get any stronger from the opponent's fear. However, this notion was subject to a retcon in the following game, where he himself states to receive power from both hatred and fear. Street Fighter V supports this notion, as his Psycho Power is empowered by all kinds of negative emotions. Notable Attacks/Techniques: HellAttack.gif|Hell Attack PsychoAxe.gif|Psycho Axe ShadowAxe.gif|Shadow Axe PsychoBeak.gif|Psycho Break DeadlyKick.gif|Deadly Middle Kick FocusBison.gif|Focus Attack *Hell
