with Keysword, up to Higher than baseline Complex Multiversal (7-D) with Keysword's abilities. Interdimensional & Extradimensional (7-D) with Keysword's abilities }} {| class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" align="center" border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:100%" | colspan="2" style="text-align: left; " |Standard Equipment: |- | GokuToeiEquip4.png|Power Pole GokuToeiEquip5.png|Flying Nimbus GokuToeiEquip6.png|Senzu Beans Zeno button.png|Zen'ō Button Full Universe Tree.png|Universe Tree *{{Nihongo|Power Pole||Nyoi Bō}}: A magical, length-changing staff that is owned and wielded by Goku for most of the original Dragon Ball series. Before Master Roshi gave the Power Pole to Grandpa Gohan (who later gave it to Goku prior to the start of Dragon Ball), it was owned by Korin. Although Goku uses it primarily as a weapon, its true purpose is to use its size-changing ability to travel from Korin Tower to The Lookout. However the only time Goku as utilized the staff during the Z era was in the film Dead Zone. Other than that he did not use it, however he still can get it when he want *{{Nihongo|Flying Nimbus||Kinto'un}}: A magical, yellow cloud that serves as a way of transportation. Goku obtains the Nimbus from Master Roshi as compensation for saving Turtle. It served Goku and his sons well throughout Dragon Ball and Dragon Ball Z, by acting as a way for them to fly around at high speeds without using up any energy. *{{Nihongo|Senzu Beans||Senzu}}: When eaten, a person's physical condition is near-instantly restored to its natural peak. This property makes them immensely useful to carry in battle. As such, since Korin allied himself with Goku and his friends, Korin usually assists them by providing the Dragon Team with a bag of Senzu Beans. However, the supply is limited, as it takes a long time to grow even a single Senzu Bean. *Zen'ō Button: A button given to Goku by Zen'ō himself, it allow Goku to summon SDBH Zen'ō to erase his enemies or teleport Goku to Zen'ō's Palace As Super Saiyan Blue: Universe Tree Power he has access to: *{{Nihongo|Universe Tree||Uchūju}}: Is a cosmic tree which has the power to absorb energy and create new universes. Its existence even feared by the Gods of Destruction. In the climax of Big Bang Mission, by absorbing energy from Universe Tree, Goku transformed into Super Saiyan Blue: Universe Tree Power, increase his powers unfathomably to the point where he is capable of combating with Fu: Youth. By using the Tree as energy source, he constantly resupplies and amplifies his own power to combat Fu. The Tree itself can also act as a weapon that aid Goku in battle by constantly releasing its aura that contain multiple harmful abilities from many power its had absorbed, and its own overwhelming and raw destructive power |} {| class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" align="center" border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:100%" | colspan="2" style="text-align: left; " |Optional Equipment: |- | GokuToeiEquip3.png|Potara Earring 545801-default image earth dragon balls object page .png|Dragon Balls Keysword-SDBH.png|Keysword |-|Universe Mission to Big Bang Mission= *: Are special earrings worn by Supreme Kais and their apprentices. Despite being worn so casually, they have incredible properties, allowing two individuals to fuse or permitting the wearer to use the Time Rings. Given by Shin in Universe Mission and Salsa in Big Bang Mission to fuse with CC Vegeta if needed *{{nihongo|Dragon Balls||Doragon Bōru}}: Are the titular artifacts of the entire Dragon Ball metaseries. Seven Magic spheres that allow Goku to summon Wish Dragon and can give Goku up to 3 wishes if he has them all |-|Ultra God Mission= Previous item except Potara Earring *: Is a powerful weapon that was forged by a god to deal with the Demon Realm and its inhabitants. Starting from Ultra God Mission, Goku can summon the sword in its dormant state to aid him in battle |} Intelligence: {{Border|Scroll=No|Visible=Yes|Padding=Yes|Content= |-|General= |-|Combat= {{Border|Scroll=Yes|Visible=No|Content= Superior to his DBS Anime, DBS Manga and DBZ Toei counterparts combined. Capable of going toe to toe with extremely skilled fighters who can use special abilities to assists them in battle such as Hearts with his gravity power, Demon Gods like Demigra (Heroes) who have access to magic that "transcends human knowledge" and also using power like Dark Ki and Dark Factor, and Supreme Kai of Time like Aeos, [https://imgur.com/nv1ZXJ0 anticipated and intercepted her, blocked her attempts] at using Time Power's abilities; Later [https://imgur.com/a/gaP5V1p he adapted and countered Aeos through sheer skills despite the Time Goddess used Time Power's abilities to assists her in battle, even overwhelmed her and won], Performed a similar feat back when he fought Broly, fought Dark King Demigra [https://imgur.com/a/qFnHPqN and despite being weakened and injured, he briefly trade blows with Demigra and managed to scratch
--- 11 [intelligence] obito-uchiha.yaml
{{Border|Scroll=No|Visible=Yes|Padding=Yes|Content= |-|Teen= |-|Adult= |-|Kid Obito (Post-Injury)= |-|Masked Man= |-|Tobi= |-|Fourth Great Ninja War= |-|Jūbi Jinchūriki= |-|Post Jūbi Extraction= }} {| class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" align="center" border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:100%" |- ! colspan="2" style="text-align:center; background-color:#3a2a5e; color:#f2f2f2;" | Notable Attacks/Techniques |- |- | |-|Nature Transformation={{Border|Scroll=Yes|Visible=No|Content= {{Nihongo|Nature Transformation||Seishitsu Henka}}: At the core of Ninjutsu is the Great Changes in [Chakra] Nature. Fundamentally, there are five Chakra Natures. Fire, Wind, Water, Earth and Lightning. Fire results in Fire Style, changing the characteristics and attributes of chakra to fire. Water results in Water Style, changing the characteristics and attributes of chakra to water, and so on. There are different relationship between natures. For example, Water Style counters Fire Style, and Fire Style counters Wind Style. These changes in Chakra Nature are the foundation of all elemental Ninjutsu, their creation, and development. In addition to the five basic changes in chakra nature, there also exists Yin Style and Yang Style. Yin Style is primarily based on mental energies, and can be used to create form out of naught. It is the basis for many sub-categories and techniques, such as Genjutsu and Hiden like the Nara clan's Shadow Possession Jutsu. On the other hand, Yang Style is predicated on the user's physical energies, and can infuse life into a life-less form. Examples of Yang Style include the Akimichi clan's Multi-Size techniques. Usually Chakra Natures are used individually and separately, when performing Fire Style one only taps into the Fire Chakra Nature. However, it is possible to activate multiple Chakra Natures simultaneously which results in an entirely new Chakra Nature. For example, Obito can use Wood Style by activating both Water and Earth Chakra Natures at the same time. These new natures are classified as Kekkei Genkai. *{{Nihongo|Fire Style||Katon}}: One of the fundamental elemental nature transformations. It is performed by molding superheated chakra inside the stomach before releasing it via the lungs and mouth. There are also variants to this in some mediums, such as gun powder, explosive tags, and chakra flow into a weapon. The produced flames carry the properties of real flames, producing scorching heat, and burning whatever they touch to ash. Concentrated chakra can also inherently produce great heat, enough to burn someone from the inside out or carve through iron. Katon1.jpeg Katon2.jpeg *{{Nihongo|Lightning Style||Raiton}}: One of the basic elemental nature transformation techniques that allow the user to generate lightning by increasing the high-frequency vibrations of their chakra, allowing for piercing damage and fast movement. The electricity also can paralyze the target. While uncommon, lightning can be infused into bladed weapons in a way similar to Wind Style through chakra flow for increased piercing power through vibrations, with the added effect of inducing numbness. center|400px center|400px center|400px * {{Nihongo|Water Style||Suiton}}: One of the basic elemental nature transformation techniques and allows the user to manipulate and shape surrounding water or create water without a source, such as projecting it from the mouth. This chakra nature becomes far more powerful if the user has a large water source near them, as it will both save them some chakra and increase the volume of water at their disposal. Suiton1.jpeg Suiton2.jpeg *{{Nihongo|Earth Style||Doton}}: One of the basic elemental nature transformations. With Earth Style, the user can manipulate the very earth, altering its shape, size, and density. This power can be used to either increase the hardness of something in order to boost its durability, or to make something far more pliable and easy to pass through. The former can be demonstrated with techniques like the Iron Spear and the latter with techniques such as the Hidden Mole Jutsu. Earth Style jutsu can also simply allow the user to manipulate the surrounding terrain as they see fit. It allows for the manipulation and generation of rocks, clay, earth, soil, and everything in between. Doton2.jpeg Doton3.jpeg Doton1.jpeg *{{Nihongo|Wind Style||Fūton}}: One of the five fundamental elemental nature transformations. It is performed by making chakra as sharp and thin as possible. Wind Style is mainly short to mid-ranged offensive techniques that combine brute force and keen precision to deal devastating cutting and slashing damage to their target. Indeed, Wind Style is extremely effective at dealing cutting damage, and has been touted as capable of slicing apart anything. Wind Style techniques are usually performed by generating air circulation and can be enhanced through this method as well. Applying Wind Style chakra to weapons also greatly enhances their c
