 Setting, as explained here, meaning that cosmological aspects are shared between all of these different continuities. However, if there are any contradictions, then they’re dealt with within a case-by-case context. If there is truly a contradiction then it would not be applied. The shared worldview and setting was accepted in this thread. ==Knowledgeable Members== *SSJRyu1 *Elizhaa *AppleLord *AKM sama *KingEzran *ArgosaxDespair *ProfectusInfinity *StarShooter80 ==Supporters and Opponents of the Series== ===Supporters=== ===Neutral=== ===Opponents=== ==Characters== ===Heroes=== DBZIcon1.webp|Son Goku (DB)|link=Son Goku (Classic Toei) DBZIcon2.webp|Son Goku (DBZ)|link=Son Goku (Toei) DBZIcon3.1.webp|Son Goku (DBGT)|link=Son Goku (Dragon Ball GT) DBZIcon4.webp|Vegeta (DBZ)|link=Vegeta (Toei) DBZIcon5.webp|Vegeta (DBGT)|link=Vegeta (Dragon Ball GT) DBZIcon6.webp|Son Gohan|link=Son Gohan (Toei) PvZFutureGohan1.webp|Future Gohan|link=Future Gohan (Toei) DBZIcon7.webp|Piccolo|link=Piccolo (Toei) DBZKrillin.webp|Krillin|link=Krillin (Toei) DBZTrunks55.webp|Trunks|link=Trunks (Toei) DBZGoten54.webp|Son Goten|link=Son Goten (Toei) DBZPan.webp|Pan|link=Pan DBZUub44.webp|Uub|link=Uub (Dragon Ball GT) DBZToeiBlender6.webp|Tapion|link=Tapion DBZToeiBlender7.webp|Pikkon|link=Pikkon === Aliens and Races === DBZToeiBlender1.webp|Frieza|link=Frieza (Toei) DBZToeiBlender2.webp|Cooler|link=Cooler DBZChillBro.webp|Chilled|link=Chilled DBZToeiBlender3.webp|Dore|link=Dore DBZToeiBlender4.webp|Salza|link=Salza DBZToeiBlender5.webp|Neiz|link=Neiz DBZToeiBlueGuylol.webp|Abo|link=Abo and Kado DBZToeiRedGuylol.webp|Kado|link=Abo and Kado KingVegeta.png|King Vegeta|link=King Vegeta (Toei) DBZToeiBardock.webp|Bardock|link=Bardock (Toei) DBZTurles.webp|Turles|link=Turles DBZBroly.webp|Broly|link=Broly (Toei) DBZParagus.webp|Paragus|link=Paragus (Toei) DBZToeiSerpia.webp|Seripa|link=Seripa DBZBrocco.webp|Brocco|link=Brocco DBZPumpkin.webp|Pumpkin|link=Pumpkin (Dragon Ball) DBZToeiGarlicDahJr1.we