Below Average Human | Peak Human ([https://imgur.com/jPuAvtk Can carry up to 3] Star Allies lining up above her without being slowed down or hindering her mobility, even if the first one jumps away and manage to pull herself into the opposite direction on ground or air when in the weaker ranges of those moves, which affect the likes of Kirby, Meta Knight, King Dedede and Bandana Waddle Dee in the same way.. Adeleine's Friend Heart · Kirby Star Allies.gif|Friend Heart · Kirby Star Allies Everybody using Friend Hearts-27th anniversary twitter video.gif|Adeleine making use of a Friend Heart *Friend Heart: Obtained in Kirby Star Allies, Adeleine generates a Friend Heart which is then quickly thrown to his objective(s). This can be done an unlimited amount of times as well as repeatedly. Upon contact or near it, the Friend Heart will generate a major change in the empathy of the being(s) affected to the point of making them change their morality towards being friends & allies with Adeleine. [https://youtu.be/dFJPGlUjhRI?t=21 The Friend Hearts have also shown to make feel objectives extremely happy], [https://youtu.be/gcQcCnCBWMs?t=330 make them have a deep appreciation for the one who used a Friend Heart on them], generate clothes in others, work on robots, [https://imgur.com/a/pZbLxWB heal & purify others], [https://youtu.be/k8f2lw5c30A?t=6421 operate without making direct contact to others' bodies as well as affect] [https://youtu.be/l8XC_r3LtVI?t=421 more than one being at a time]. Friend Hearts were also shown either creating or turning small [https://imgur.com/Hrx2S01 areas they reached] [https://imgur.com/vAglOM1 into Friend Platforms] (Creation or Transmutation), an ability any Star Ally may possess, but no character in Star Allies uses Friend Hearts in this manner or were aware that this happened. The last function the Friend Hearts have is that their sentient targets will immediately be bestowed with the ability the generate and use Friend Hearts with all previously mentioned characteristics. *Positive Energy Manipulation: Called "positive energy" in America and left nameless & vague in the original version. It refers to the energies Star Allies manipulate while doing Friend Actions and Team Attacks; The white energy with colorful [https://imgur.com/BiP7rqd stars around] [https://imgur.com/hbsbSBl recognized as "a mysterious power,"] which may trigger with a heart-shaped wave. What exactly positive energy is is a bit vague, but it's related to [https://imgur.com/a/P0mTrRv friendship and companionship], and should be the opposite of "negative energy" (American name)/ "[https://imgur.com/esI7seH substance of darkness]" (Original name. Since it can be translated as "dark matter," it is not to be confused with Dark Matter), which is conformed by, or related to, [https://imgur.com/mSsaCYx hatred, obsession, jealousy, desire], [https://imgur.com/a/hrofIDe and may be invisible] (Hyness says the Jamba Heart "is now being filled," but we don't see it being filled with physical things at the time). In short, [https://imgur.com/esI7seH they are] types of energies that respectively relate to morally good, healthy attitudes and evil, unhealthy attitudes. The use of positive energy allows Star Allies to form certain energy-based moves, power up attacks, and use certain abilities in the first place. The Star Allies' every move is filled with positive energy, considering how Void, [https://imgur.com/w1TIMtc a being born] [https://imgur.com/mSsaCYx from darkness] when playable. The ability to bestow elemental abilities to fellow Star Allies, and their use of certain collaborative techniques, are also Friend Abilities. They all use the previously mentioned "positive energy." **Friend Action: They all supposedly need 4 allies in total to be done and, gameplay wise, a special platform to be used; This are only Game Mechanics, the narrative seems to indicate the Star Allies Sparkler to have been made by the Star Allies without mentioning said 