"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" align="center" border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:100%" | colspan="2" style="text-align: left; |Notable Attacks/Techniques: |- | Dark Cloaked Avidya Slash.png|Dark Cloaked Lightless Slash Dark Cloaked Black Blade.png|Dark Cloaked Black Blade Black Hole.png|Black Hole DarkCloakedDimensionSlicer.PNG|Dark Cloaked Dimension Slash Yami binds Patolli.png|Dark Binding Black Cocoon.png|Black Cocoon Yami's Reverse Blade Strike.png|Dark Cloaked Lightless Blunt Strike Yami slashes wildly.png|Dark Cloaked Lightless Blade Storm Yami saves Charla.png|Dark Cloaked Black Blade Blunt Slash Dark Cloaked Dimension Slash Equinox.png|Mana Zone Dark Cloaked Dimension Slash: Equinox Yami Black Moon.jpg|Mana Zone Black Moon Dark Cloaked Iai Slash.png|Mana Zone Condense: Dark Cloaked Iai Slash {{Nihongo|Dark Magic|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}|Yami Mahō}}: Yami's magic allows him to manipulate darkness. He primarily uses this magic to increase his physical abilities and channels it into his sword, creating destructive arcs of dark energy that are powerful enough to counter Licht's Light Magic spells. It is a rare and unique magic that was recognized by the Sorcery Emperor himself. *{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Lightless Slash|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|無|む}}{{Ruby|明|みょう}}{{Ruby|斬|ぎ}}り』 Yami Mahō "Yamimatoi: Mumyōgiri"}} Channeling his magic into his katana, Yami swings his blade, unleashing a dark arc of energy that absorbs other attacks and retains the same sharpness as an edged weapon. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Lightless Blade Storm|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|無|む}}{{Ruby|明|みょう}}{{Ruby|乱|みだ}}れ{{Ruby|斬|ぎ}}り』|Yami Mahō "Yamimatoi: Mumyō Midaregiri"}}: Yami coats their sword in Dark Magic and swings it in a disorderly fashion, creating multiple Dark Cloaked Avidya Slashes. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Black Blade|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|黒|くろ}}{{Ruby|刃|ば}}』|Yami Mahō "Yamimatoi: Kuroba"}} By coating his katana with darkness, Yami can increase the range and power of his swings. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Black Blade Blunt Slash|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|黒|くろ}}{{Ruby|刃|ば}}{{Ruby|峰|みね}}{{Ruby|薙|な}}ぎ』|Yami Mahō "Yamimatoi: Kuroba Minenagi"}}: Yami coats a sword in darkness and extends the blade by shaping the darkness. Then he swings the blade wide and pushes a target back with the blunt side of the sword. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Lightless Blunt Strike|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|無|む}}{{Ruby|明|みょう}}{{Ruby|峰|みね}}{{Ruby|打|う}}ち』|Yami Mahō "Yamimatoi: Mumyō Mineuchi"}}: Yami coats his sword with Dark Magic, goes behind their target, and strikes the target's nape with the back of their sword. The blow is strong enough to knock the target unconscious, and since it is done with the blunt side of the sword, the target is not grievously injured. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Black Cocoon|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|黒繭|くろまゆ}}』|Yami Mahō "Kuromayu"}}: Yami creates a spherical shell of darkness around themselves. The sphere can also be used as a means of transport. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Black Hole|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|黒穴|くろあな}}』|Yami Mahō "Kuroana"}}: Yami creates a singularity of darkness that draws in incoming projectile attacks, nullifying them in the process, but is limited by the singularity's small size. **{{Nihongo|Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Dimension Slash|{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|魔|ま}}{{Ruby|法|ほう}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|次|じ}}{{Ruby|元|げん}}{{Ruby|斬|ぎ}}り』|Yami Mahō "Yamimatoi: Jigengiri"}}: A powerful slash that cuts through "dimensions" (space) itself, which Yami described as being able to cut through anything. Yami developed this attack as he was trapped and pushed to the brink watching his men fight a battle to the death. **Mana Zone: Dark Cloaked Dimension Slash: Equinox: Greater version of Dark Cloaked Dimension Slash, extending its range and reach. **{{Nihongo|Mana Zone: Black Moon|{{Ruby|魔何|マナ}}ゾーン『{{Ruby|黒月|くろづき}}』|Mana Zōn "Kurozuki"}}: Yami takes control of the surrounding mana and then creates a Black Hole overhead, expanding the range of its absorption over a defined area. Yami is also able to discriminate what gets absorbed by the spell, such as erasing an opponent's spell while leaving an ally's spell unaffected. **{{Nihongo|Mana Zone Condense: Dark Cloaked Iai Slash|{{Ruby|魔何|マナ}}ゾーン{{Ruby|凝縮|ぎょうしゅく}}『{{Ruby|闇|やみ}}{{Ruby|纏|まとい}}・{{Ruby|居|い}}{{Ruby|合|あい}}{{Ruby|斬|ぎ}}り』|Mana Zōn "Iaigiri"}}: Yami sheathes his sword, condenses the area of Black Moon's effect, and waits for his opponent to attack. Once the opponent is in range, Yami coats his sword in darkness, quickly draws the blade, and dashes forward, slashing the opponent across the stomach. **{
