Gifted (A very wise man with several decades of experience and a master of the yoga arts, to the point of being considered one of the seven yoga masters in the world.Street Fighter V - Dhalsim's Character Story Serves as a spiritual guide and mentor to many people and is always ready to give precious advice to those who seek help, such as Ryu, Alex, the Player and all the peregrines visiting his temple. Is an expert in mysticism and philosophy, and often engages in discussions on the matter with Oro. He is also a great martial artist, having developed many abilities through meditation and self-improvement. Even when holding back, he can battle on par with the likes of Karin, Ryu, Necalli, Alex, Rufus, Rashid, Rainbow Mika |-|Unique Attacks= YogaUpper.gif|Yoga Upper Divine kick.gif|Divine Kick ThrustKick.gif|Thrust Kick YogaAnvil.gif|Yoga Anvil DrillKick.gif|Drill Kick Yoga mummy.gif|Yoga Mummy Yoga tower.gif| Yoga Tower Yoga chop.gif|Yoga Chop YogaSweep.gif|Yoga Sweep Focus dhalsim.gif|Focus Attack *Yoga Upper: Dhalsim performs a quick, open-handed, uppercut that hits almost vertically above him. *Divine Kick: Dhalsim performs a front kick with his hands put together. *Thrust Kick: Dhalsim crouches low and extends his leg out toward his opponent. *Yoga Anvil: Dhalsim extends both of his arms upward at a 45° angle. *Yoga Spear/Drill Kick: Dhalsim performs a drill-like kick downward towards his opponent. *Yoga Mummy: Dhalsim slowly twirls downward, spinning like a drill, and hitting the opponent headfirst. *Yoga Tower: Dhalsim raises his body into the air by stretching his leg, allowing most attacks to pass under him. *Yoga Chop: Dhalsim strikes his opponent with a downward, open-handed chop. *Yoga Sweep: Dhalsim stretches his leg and slides forward, hitting the opponent with the tip of his foot. *Focus
